    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 390,
      "text": "# 阅读材料\n\n一段值得保留的笔记，需要哪些上下文？\n\n**观察记录 · 示例材料**\n\n只留下摘录，往往会忘记当时为什么标记这句话。记录问题和出处，才能在写作时重新使用。",
      "bcAutoResize": false,
      "bcResearchPreset": "source",
      "color": "#a84e34",
      "bcResearchIntensity": 26,
      "bcTextAlign": "left",
      "bcShape": "square",
      "bcBorderStyle": "solid",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "border": "solid",
        "textAlign": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 435,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "> 保留一句话，也保留当时的问题。\n\n摘录自左侧示例材料。",
      "bcAutoResize": false,
      "bcResearchPreset": "quote",
      "color": "#b48a28",
      "bcResearchIntensity": 26,
      "bcTextAlign": "left",
      "bcShape": "square",
      "bcBorderStyle": "solid",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "border": "solid",
        "textAlign": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 435,
      "y": 495,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "## 我的批注\n\n摘录负责保留原话。\n批注负责记录理解。",
      "bcAutoResize": false,
      "bcResearchPreset": "annotation",
      "color": "#416879",
      "bcResearchIntensity": 26,
      "bcTextAlign": "left",
      "bcShape": "square",
      "bcBorderStyle": "solid",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "border": "solid",
        "textAlign": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "argument",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 875,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 355,
      "height": 305,
      "text": "# 让观点能够回到来源\n\n把证据与解释分开记录，\n再用连线说明两者的关系。\n\n**写作从整理关系开始。**",
      "bcAutoResize": false,
      "bcResearchPreset": "argument",
      "color": "#63734a",
      "bcResearchIntensity": 26,
      "bcTextAlign": "left",
      "bcShape": "square",
      "bcBorderStyle": "solid",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rectangle",
        "border": "solid",
        "textAlign": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "question",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 875,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 355,
      "height": 215,
      "text": "## 继续追问\n\n哪些证据会改变这个判断？",
      "bcAutoResize": false,
